                        ],
                        "form": "ро́здыху"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cefd2c85-cae6-30af-94f9-640ae07275af",
                        "entry_id": "9ef6c9a9-1a10-3771-b279-9caa482579a2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прост. кратковременный отдых, передышка, возможность оторваться от трудов"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "05ae8dde-197c-4e16-97e6-f862fc5c722f",
                                "sense_id": "cefd2c85-cae6-30af-94f9-640ae07275af",
                                "text": "Но Потоцкий на сей раз был достоин возложенного поручения; неутомимо преследовал он их и настиг на берегу Днестра, где Бульба занял для роздыха оставленную развалившуюся крепость."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "78ee196f-1e1c-413a-9754-a924904835fe",
                                "sense_id": "cefd2c85-cae6-30af-94f9-640ae07275af",
                                "text": "Верблюдов останавливали только на самые короткие роздыхи, особенно в полдень и около полуночи."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dea31b92-8931-46e5-980b-1929c84ea76b",
                                "sense_id": "cefd2c85-cae6-30af-94f9-640ae07275af",
                                "text": "Эти роздыхи природа дает как будто нарочно; в них молодой организм устаивается и крепнет для новой бури."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ef1140d5-f8b2-4757-a5ef-0ddba24e5712",
                        "source_entry_id": "9ef6c9a9-1a10-3771-b279-9caa482579a2",
                        "source_sense_id": "cefd2c85-cae6-30af-94f9-640ae07275af",
                        "target_lang_word": "breather",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "breather",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5aa79003-ce5b-3055-8d69-8beb1ce917a3",
                                        "entry_id": "76d44634-8755-3d78-8664-7fc2376285a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something or someone that breathes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67f7697f-848f-3de6-97a8-aaf8d878eac5",
                                        "entry_id": "76d44634-8755-3d78-8664-7fc2376285a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A heavy breather."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "specifically"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be1f9628-8a1b-41ee-a7a2-cdd5671f9117",
                                                "sense_id": "67f7697f-848f-3de6-97a8-aaf8d878eac5",
                                                "text": "Most of us make sense of the world through talk and sight, and breathers represent that most anxiety provoking experience, nothingness with a hint of possibility."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "22527e13-f840-38d5-ad48-609c10c7b666",
                                        "entry_id": "76d44634-8755-3d78-8664-7fc2376285a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A short break; a rest or respite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fe9bacf-18a8-4b43-a797-e7e9b6d8592a",
                                                "sense_id": "22527e13-f840-38d5-ad48-609c10c7b666",
                                                "text": "After a short breather she was ready to continue up the hill."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ae6d589-fe28-46b9-9176-e14f0d9da151",
                                                "sense_id": "22527e13-f840-38d5-ad48-609c10c7b666",
                                                "text": "I took a breather and decided not to ruin my life"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "855648fd-96e1-3a1f-ac42-300f3506bd3b",
                                        "entry_id": "76d44634-8755-3d78-8664-7fc2376285a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A spatially localized, time-periodic excitation in a one-dimensional lattice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8a9bb7d-414a-30d6-975c-a831701e78b9",
                                        "entry_id": "76d44634-8755-3d78-8664-7fc2376285a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which puts one out of breath, such as violent exercise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae043c8b-7eac-3906-b78f-4e62c08a47e2",
                                        "entry_id": "76d44634-8755-3d78-8664-7fc2376285a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An air inlet path to the crankcase"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb09097c-42bc-4818-bba1-6eeaa5454d6e",
                        "source_entry_id": "9ef6c9a9-1a10-3771-b279-9caa482579a2",
